          "gap_reason": "The only supplied statement placing the alleged sub-tenancy after 9 June 1952 is the appellant's allegation. The supplied record does not give the date on which Onkar Nath's tenancy was created or a finding fixing the date of any later disposition by him. The contrary record that the two named occupants were already in possession before, and at the creation of, Onkar Nath's tenancy makes the timing of a tenant-created disposition materially contested.",
